5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,We need to verify if the flat fee covers actual costs. Last year’s side spending was uneven.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shion,,Sleep quality dictates performance. I need to know the noise levels and bed arrangements first.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minato,,I worry about the paperwork. Who handles the forms? I want to avoid that burden.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Misaki,,The account is still negative from last year. We must pick a destination with zero hidden fees.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"If we pick a place where people stay in separate rooms, we won’t talk. I want shared spaces.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Misaki, I agree. We need a clear liability clause for cancellations. Who pays if someone drops out?","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Takumi, shared rooms are fine if the mattresses are decent. I’ll check the physical setup.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Minato,,"@Asuka, I can look at the transport receipts. It seems less stressful than legal forms.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Minato, please check the transport costs. I will look at the public bed rates to cap the budget.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Takumi,,I will check the seniors’ comments on mixing. I need to know if they actually interact.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I will investigate the accounts from clubs that went inland. Their data might show hidden costs.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shion,,I will look into the attendance sheets. Low attendance usually means bad sleep or bad food.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Minato,,"I will check the canteen closure info. If we cook, the duty is too heavy for me.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Misaki,,I will also check the vacation timetable for our own hall. It might be a cheaper fallback.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Takumi,,I will also check the membership list against first-train times. Late arrivals kill the group vibe.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
