35,2,1,talk,Asuka,,The inland accounts show eight to a room. That’s a nightmare for sleep. But the rate is fixed.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Shion,,"@Asuka, eight to a room explains the low attendance. I found the same pattern in the sheets.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Minato,,"The canteen is closed. If we pick a place with no kitchen staff, we cook. I can’t do that.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"The public beds are 1,100 yen a night. That’s the lowest I’ve seen. No hidden equipment fees.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Takumi,,The seniors say mixing only happens in shared rooms. And a third of us can’t arrive on time without pre-booking.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Misaki, 1,100 yen is good, but if we need private rooms, the cost triples. We need a middle ground.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Minato, if we pick a place with a canteen, you don’t cook. I’ll check if the public beds have one.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Minato,,"@Shion, that would be perfect. I just want to avoid the cooking duty. It took too much time last year.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Asuka, the public beds include the hall. If we use our own hall, we save on equipment, but the schedule is bad.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Misaki, the hall schedule is bad, but the public beds are cheap. I think we should look at the public beds.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Asuka,,The public beds are the only option with a fixed rate. I can’t accept variable costs. I support the public beds.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Shion,,The public beds have a canteen. That solves Minato’s problem. And the rate is low. I support the public beds.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Minato,,The public beds have a canteen. I don’t have to cook. And the transport is cheaper if we stay local. I support the public beds.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Misaki,,"The public beds are 1,100 yen a night. That’s the lowest cost. And the hall is included. I support the public beds.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Takumi,,The public beds are shared. That’s where the seniors say mixing happens. And the rate is low. I support the public beds.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
